{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"圭亚那","country_iso":"GUY","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:40:11.222886","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"GUY-HB-0006","ldc":"No","location":"Aurora","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"圭亚那奥罗拉金矿15MW光伏+10MWh储能微电网项目","project_name_en":"Guyana Aurora Gold Mine 15MW PV + 10MWh BESS Microgrid Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"江苏电建一公司","content":"近日，中国能建江苏电建一公司与福建龙净环保股份有限公司签约圭亚那奥罗拉金矿微电网EPC项目，实现了圭亚那新能源市场开发新突破。\n该项目位于圭亚那奥罗拉金矿矿区，距首都乔治敦市以西约170公里。项目拟建容量为15兆瓦光伏和10兆瓦时电化学储能系统，江苏电建一公司负责执行该项目在交钥匙基础上的所有工作和服务。\n项目建成后，将极大缓解当地矿山企业的用电成本，帮助矿山企业迅速扩大产能，同时提高矿产企业用电的稳定性，为提升矿产企业经济效益和提振当地工业经济发展提供有力支撑。","content_sha256":"c12489dc30b2da4e23bf15b04bb15cd8b16bbe248b0c49f1f4d981051251c532","id":11379,"publish_date":"2023-10-25 22:37:02","title":"中国能建江苏电建一公司签约圭亚那微电网EPC项目","title_sha256":"c4b2e4ba1182aa59d1070ac0f1da2e6ee0d556fd4c949d130647d86e8fb38f7f","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/50825.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"GUY-HB-0006","capacity_details":"PV: 15MW, BESS: 10MWh","capacity_mw":15.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"15","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:40:11.223223","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"GUY-HB-0006-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ceec.net.cn/art/2024/9/27/art_11019_2532967.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"中国能建江苏电建一公司在圭亚那签约奥罗拉金矿微电网EPC项目，该项目包含15兆瓦光伏和10兆瓦时储能系统，旨在缓解当地矿山用电成本并提高稳定性，目前处于签约阶段。","publish_date":"2023-10-25 2